# The API reports are written by api-extractor in its own layout. Reformatting
# them would put prettier and the generator in a loop, each undoing the other,
# and `npm run api:check` compares the file byte for byte.
docs/api

# The golden corpus is data, not source. Reformatting a manifest would change
# its bytes, break the SHA-256 digests recorded in PROVENANCE.md, and trip
# golden:check for a reason that has nothing to do with the format.
tests/golden

# Site-root tokens (search-engine and CA verification). Their contents are fixed
# by the issuer and verification fails on any edit, including a trailing newline.
src/web/site-root

# The specification the architecture diagram is rendered from. It carries a
# SHA-256 receipt recorded at delivery time, and reformatting it would break
# that receipt without changing what the diagram says. Regenerate the PNG with
# the archify skill after editing it, then run `npm run architecture:check`.
docs/architecture.archify.json

# Locally installed Claude Code skills, vendored from upstream and formatted to
# their own conventions. Reformatting them would produce a large diff against
# code this repository does not own. Also ignored by git.
.claude/
